WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A force acting along a distance transfers work in this simple model.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
100 newtons through 20 metres is 2,000 joules of work.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Deliver 2,000 joules in 10 seconds: average power is 200 watts.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
This idealized example does not size a motor or powertrain.
